<%- include('partials/header') %>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/volunteer.css">

<main class="page-main-with-hero volunteer-subpage-main host-assembly-main">
  <!-- Match the Volunteer baseline with a rounded hero image above the sidebar and content cards. -->
  <section class="page-hero-top host-assembly-hero" aria-label="Host an Assembly Day hero image">
    <img src="/images/2022/11/BKF-women-with-kits.jpg" alt="Women holding clean birth kits">
  </section>

  <div class="page-body-with-sidebar">
    <%- include('partials/volunteerSideMenu') %>

    <div class="page-content host-assembly-page">
    <section class="had-intro">
      <h1>HOST AN ASSEMBLY DAY</h1>

      <p>
        Our Clean Birth Kits are a valuable resource in emergency and humanitarian settings to help
        prevent infection for mothers and newborns.
      </p>

      <p>
        Kits are fundraised and assembled by volunteers, both in Australia and internationally,
        through the Clean Birth Kit Initiative.
        <strong>The cost of a kit is AU$5 in Australia and US$7-10 internationally.</strong>
      </p>

      <p>
        All of our birth kits are environmentally friendly. The plastic bag and sheets are treated
        with an organic compound and are biodegradable in microbe rich environments, such as landfill.
      </p>

      <p>
        As an organisation, we aim to review the social and environmental impact of the birth kits
        annually, part of our commitment to better understand our impact to the global environment.
      </p>

      <p>
        You can pack kits as part of a large community event clubs, schools, businesses or opt to
        pack a smaller number of <a href="/volunteer/kitsathome" class="volunteer-inline-link">Kits at Home</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="had-action-boxes">
      <a
        class="had-action-box"
        href="https://forms.monday.com/forms/faf9592aeb1d0cead561462b72420131?r=apse2"
        target="_blank"
      >
        BOOK AN ASSEMBLY DAY EVENT
      </a>

      <a class="had-action-box" href="/resources">
        ASSEMBLY DAY RESOURCES
      </a>

      <a class="had-action-box" href="/Volunteer/KitsAtHome">
        BOOK A KITS AT HOME EVENT
      </a>
    </section>
    </div>
  </div>
